[I] A library providing Qt implementation of DBusMenu specification

[T] libdbusmenu-qt provides a Qt implementation of the DBusMenu protocol.
[T] The protocol makes it possible for applications to export and import
[T] their menus over D-Bus, for example to show them in a global menu bar or
[T] a system tray.

[U] https://launchpad.net/libdbusmenu-qt

[A] Canonical DX Team
[A] Aurélien Gâtea <aurelien.gateau@canonical.com>
